## Scenarios

### flat parser transient array scope

#### reclaims parse arrays only after owned module conversion starts

- Verify: reclaims parse arrays only after owned module conversion starts
   - Expected: shell_write_text(fixture, transient_arrays_fixture()) is true
   - Expected: rc equals `0`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 9 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-COMPILER-BOOTSTRAP-001
step("Verify: reclaims parse arrays only after owned module conversion starts")
val fixture = "build/land11_spec_fx/transient_arrays.spl"
expect(shell_write_text(fixture, transient_arrays_fixture())).to_equal(true)
val (out, _err, rc) = rt_process_run_timeout(compiler_binary(), ["run", fixture], 300000)
expect(rc).to_equal(0)
# 10+20+30+40+1+2+3 = 106: array literals parsed into transient arrays
# and desugared collections are intact in the built module.
expect(out).to_contain("106")
```

</details>

#### does not run the arena rewrite after transient arrays are reclaimed

- Verify: does not run the arena rewrite after transient arrays are reclaimed
   - Expected: mk equals `0`
   - Expected: rc equals `0`


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 13 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-COMPILER-BOOTSTRAP-001
step("Verify: does not run the arena rewrite after transient arrays are reclaimed")
# Reclaim-then-rewrite would corrupt or drop already-converted arrays;
# running the same fixture through a symlinked path also exercises the
# driver's physical-source dedup on the way in.
val fixture = "build/land11_spec_fx/transient_arrays.spl"
val (_out2, _err2, mk) = rt_process_run_timeout("/bin/sh",
    ["-c", "if ln -sfn transient_arrays.spl build/land11_spec_fx/transient_arrays_link.spl; then printf 'OK'; else printf 'FAIL'; fi"], 30000)
expect(mk).to_equal(0)
val (out, _err, rc) = rt_process_run_timeout(compiler_binary(),
    ["run", "build/land11_spec_fx/transient_arrays_link.spl"], 300000)
expect(rc).to_equal(0)
expect(out).to_contain("106")
```

</details>

